  "title": "Where Does Curly Hair Come From?",
  "summary": "Your hair texture is just one part of what makes us totally unique individuals. Plenty of physical attributes are predetermined by genetics. From eye color, to height and bone structure, we all possess visible ties to our family ancestry through genetics. Today we’ll explore why our hair looks the way it does and exactly how the genes you inherit from your parents, and sometimes even your parent’s parents, can determine your hair texture!",
